# Portfolio AI Skills

Follow the modular skill system in `docs/skills/`. Guide:
`.doc/AI_Skill_Architecture_Guide.md`.

## Always (Level 1)

Before substantive work, treat these as loaded:

- `docs/skills/level-1/L1-Core-Principles.md`
- `docs/skills/level-1/L1-Coding-Standards.md`
- `docs/skills/level-1/L1-Folder-Structure.md`
- `docs/skills/level-1/L1-TypeScript.md`

## On demand

1. Read only the Level 2 skills needed for the task (`docs/skills/level-2/`).
2. Read only the Level 3 skills needed (`docs/skills/level-3/`).
3. Do not reverse dependencies (L3 → L2 → L1 only).
4. Do not duplicate rules already defined in a referenced skill.
5. For TanStack/React library depth, use `AGENTS.md` Intent commands and
   `.agents/skills/*` instead of re-teaching APIs.

